					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I don't want to be weird, but who on earth would ever bite a raw eggplant? They taste terrible uncooked.* I get that might be the point of making them taste like actual shit, but since they taste like figurative shit before cooking anyways, why was Molly biting them in the first place? They aren't like tomatoes or peppers.</p> <p>*seriously, tasting like poop might be an improvement. They are bitter and fibrous.</p> 
				 	]]>
